<div>
    <p>Dear Accounts team,</p>

    <p>A new Fixed Deposit Receipt (FDR) request has been created. Please process it via the Accounts Form (FDR).</p>

    <ul>
        <li>Tender No.: {{data.tenderNo}}</li>
        <li>Tender Name: {{data.tenderName}}</li>
        {{#if data.dueDateTime}}<li>Tender Due Date: {{data.dueDateTime}}</li>{{/if}}
        <li>FDR Purpose: {{data.fdrPurpose}}</li>
        <li>Beneficiary Name: {{data.beneficiaryName}}</li>
        <li>Payable at: {{data.payableAt}}</li>
        <li>Amount: Rs. {{data.amount}}</li>
        {{#if data.fdrExpiryDate}}<li>FDR Expiry Date: {{data.fdrExpiryDate}}</li>{{/if}}
    </ul>

    <p>The FDR is required in {{data.timeLimit}} hours.</p>

    <p>Once the FDR is created, please share the SOFT COPY of the FDR and the Docket slip with us on time using the <a href="{{data.link}}">Accounts Form (FDR)</a>.</p>

    <p>Courier Address:</p>
    <pre>{{data.courierAddress}}</pre>

    <p>Please attach the covering letter with the FDR and courier it.</p>

    <p>"Ensuring timely operations is the only source of growth"</p>

    <p>
        Regards,<br />
        {{data.tlName}},
    </p>
</div>
